<view class="page"><view class="card"><view class="title">账号与微信绑定</view><view wx:if="{{!enabled}}" class="notice">微信登录尚未配置启用；不会模拟微信成功或自动创建账号。</view><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="notice">{{message}}</view><view wx:if="{{user}}">已登录：{{user.displayName}} · {{user.email}}</view><input wx:if="{{!user}}" class="field" data-field="email" placeholder="已有账号的邮箱或登录名" value="{{email}}" bindinput="input"/><input class="field" data-field="password" password placeholder="应用密码（绑定/解绑须重新验证）" value="{{password}}" bindinput="input"/><button wx:if="{{!user}}" class="primary" bindtap="login" disabled="{{busy}}">账号密码登录</button><checkbox-group bindchange="consent"><label><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{consent}}"/>我明确同意本次微信身份认证或解绑；不按昵称合并账号</label></checkbox-group><view class="muted">微信身份仅与当前应用账号关联，不授予机构权限。不采集微信头像、昵称、手机号或 unionid；服务端仅保留 AppID 隔离的身份哈希。会话仅在内存中保存，退出或重新启动后需登录。</view><button wx:if="{{!user}}" bindtap="wechatLogin" disabled="{{busy || !enabled || !consent}}">使用已绑定微信登录</button><button wx:if="{{user && !binding.connected}}" bindtap="bind" disabled="{{busy || !enabled || !consent}}">绑定当前微信（重新验证密码）</button><button wx:if="{{binding.connected}}" bindtap="unbind" disabled="{{busy || !consent}}">解除微信绑定并退出全部设备</button><button wx:if="{{user}}" bindtap="logout" disabled="{{busy}}">退出当前登录</button><button bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新账号状态</button></view></view>
